{"id":"en_fleeing-after-bearing-dragon-king-s-twins","title":"Fleeing After Bearing Dragon King’s Twins","titleEn":"Fleeing After Bearing Dragon King’s Twins","description":"Mia, an innocent snake spirit, rescues what she believes is an injured little snake. After a single passionate night together, she later gives birth to twin dragon cubs, unaware that their father is Caspian, the Dragon King himself. She conceals herself as a servant within his palace, determined to protect her secret, not knowing that Caspian is already aware of the truth. When danger threatens her children, Mia's dormant dragon abilities emerge, setting her on a path that could lead to becoming his Queen.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/fleeing-after-bearing-dragon-kings-twins/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/fleeing-after-bearing-dragon-kings-twins/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Multiple Identities","Sweet Romance","Underdog Rise","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dudg6/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_fleeing-after-bearing-dragon-king-s-twins_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dudg6/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_fleeing-after-bearing-dragon-king-s-twins_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dudg6/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_fleeing-after-bearing-dragon-king-s-twins_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dudg6/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_fleeing-after-bearing-dragon-king-s-twins_4",